+## Objective
+Fix the following confirmed defect — repair the named cause, nothing else. This is the fourth round of TASK-047. It stands above the review ceiling of three rounds, and the blocking-class line above lifts that ceiling for this one round. It carries exactly one defect: the CI failure that line names. Nothing else is this round's work.
+
+**The failure.** The failing test runs `conformance-check.py` through a symbolic link that sits in a folder holding no `bridge_env.py`. The CI output says:
+- `MISSING Workflows line - not checked: .../bin/workflow-check.py: AttributeError`
